  (62 , 7, 'Build a divide-and-conquer solution', 'Split a problem into smaller parts, solve them and combine their results.', 'Divide; solve; combine; recurrence intuition', 'A decomposition and merge plan with all subproblems covered.', 'applied', 'planned', null),
