  (72 , 8, 'Interpret common growth rates', 'Compare constant, logarithmic, linear, linearithmic, quadratic and exponential growth conceptually.', 'Big-O; growth families; dominant term', 'A correct growth-rate ranking and explanation.', 'building', 'planned', null),
